+Processes the grid in chunks to handle larger-than-memory datasets, unlike the full-grid approach of Immediate Mode.
+
+### [Sparse Marching Cubes](3825-sparse-marching-cubes.md)
+Uses a sparse data structure to skip empty regions, improving performance over the dense grid traversal of Immediate Mode.
